

1. Tenable Discovered STIGS FAILURE WN10-CC-000355

Registry Hive: HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE
Registry Path: \SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Windows\WinRM\Service\

Value Name: DisableRunAs

Value Type: REG_DWORD
Value: 1

2. Followed advice given from Tenanble in the Check column
3. Found that \SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Windows\WinRM\Service\DisableRunAs was not created: The below code set the value:
# Define registry path and desired value
$regPath = "HKLM:\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Windows\WinRM\Service\"

# Create the path if it doesn't exist
if (-not (Test-Path $regPath)) {
    New-Item -Path $regPath -Force | Out-Null
}

Set-ItemProperty -Path $regPath -Name "DisableRunAs" -Value 1 -Type DWord
4. Restarted the computer and check if the value was there. The value was there
5. Run Tenable and WN10-CC-000355 passed
